# Density Compare
# Francium (Fr) — real density 1.87 g/cm³. equal masses: Francium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Francium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 16.2mm color: #ff00ff at (-20mm, 8.1mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 14.9 g — the water cube is the reference
